Subject: Pin Kafka 4.4 versions plugin to mirrored Gradle coordinates
Description: Kafka 4.4.0 moved the dependency-versions plugin to
  io.github.ben-manes.versions 0.56.0, which is not yet mirrored on the DHI
  Gradle plugin proxy. Keep the prior com.github.ben-manes.versions 0.53.0
  coordinates that resolve through the mirror, matching Kafka 4.3.x builds.
Origin: DHI-internal (Gradle plugin mirror)
Base-Tree: git https://github.com/apache/kafka.git 1156b2752aaa28eafc0b4c4d387e63356793268d
Regenerate: `git clone --depth 1 --branch 4.4.0 https://github.com/apache/kafka.git /tmp/kafka-4.4 && cd /tmp/kafka-4.4 && sed -i "s/id 'io.github.ben-manes.versions' version '0.56.0'/id 'com.github.ben-manes.versions' version '0.53.0'/" build.gradle && git diff -- build.gradle`
Forwarded: not-needed (DHI Gradle plugin proxy does not carry io.github.ben-manes.versions 0.56.0)
Drop-When: never: restore upstream plugin coordinates only after the DHI Gradle plugin proxy mirrors io.github.ben-manes.versions 0.56.0

